{"nodes": [{"id": "recovered_request_to_lowdin_project_request_126_untested_rows", "label": "Request \u2014 per-row member selection for 126 untested channel rows", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "recovered/REQUEST-TO-LOWDIN-PROJECT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The rows are printed as untested, which is honest and correct; if the selection is unrecoverable they stay untested, a Register entry records why, and the matter closes rather than being carried open."}, {"id": "recovered_request_to_lowdin_project_run489_py_bracket_instrument", "label": "run489.py \u2014 the sealed bracket instrument", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "recovered/REQUEST-TO-LOWDIN-PROJECT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Run unmodified under the governing ruling with strict interval membership and the quotation floor as the only epsilon; it needs the identified member levels per row, which 126 rows cannot regenerate blind."}, {"id": "recovered_request_to_lowdin_project_store_gen_py", "label": "store_gen.py \u2014 the selection generator", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "recovered/REQUEST-TO-LOWDIN-PROJECT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The strongest form of the answer because the selection can be re-run blind and is therefore verifiable rather than asserted."}, {"id": "recovered_request_to_lowdin_project_delivery_size_bands", "label": "Delivery constraints: manifest with hashes, and the size bands", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/REQUEST-TO-LOWDIN-PROJECT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A delivery without hashes can be read but cannot be trusted, and the middle size band returns inline as base64 that cannot be written to disk, so the route is chosen by size."}, {"id": "recovered_request_to_lowdin_project_recorded_negative_finding", "label": "A recorded negative finding, not a guess", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/REQUEST-TO-LOWDIN-PROJECT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Where the earlier delivery did meet the table every limit agreed exactly, so the delivery was correct and simply does not cover these species; the intersection being empty is itself banked."}], "edges": [{"source": "recovered_request_to_lowdin_project_request_126_untested_rows", "target": "recovered_request_to_lowdin_project_run489_py_bracket_instrument", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/REQUEST-TO-LOWDIN-PROJECT.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_request_to_lowdin_project_request_126_untested_rows", "target": "recovered_request_to_lowdin_project_store_gen_py", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/REQUEST-TO-LOWDIN-PROJECT.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_request_to_lowdin_project_delivery_size_bands", "target": "recovered_request_to_lowdin_project_request_126_untested_rows", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/REQUEST-TO-LOWDIN-PROJECT.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_request_to_lowdin_project_recorded_negative_finding", "target": "recovered_request_to_lowdin_project_request_126_untested_rows", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/REQUEST-TO-LOWDIN-PROJECT.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_request_to_lowdin_project_request_126_untested_rows", "target": "recovered_request_mc10_